Mastra Factory
--------------
This app wraps and hosts Mastra Factory, an open-source environment for
building software with coding agents, without rebranding it.

  Upstream:  https://github.com/mastra-ai/mastra (mastracode/factory)
             https://github.com/mastra-ai/softwarefactory-template
  License:   Apache License 2.0
  Branding:  "Mastra Factory" and the Factory UI are Mastra's. The app icon
             is the Factory PWA mark, and the interface keeps Factory's own
             name and presentation.

The bundled template (vendor/mastra-factory in the Dareecho tree,
Resources/factory-template in this app) is an unmodified copy of the
upstream template at a pinned commit; see its PROVENANCE record.

The wrapper app (this directory) is MIT licensed, Copyright Zermo, and is
part of Dareecho.
